### 0 cli query weather.x.md map(diagnostics, fn(r) => {line: r.line, severity: r.severity, message: r.message}) --json
$ xmd query weather.x.md map(diagnostics, fn(r) => {line: r.line, severity: r.severity, message: r.message}) --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
