### 1 cli query errors.x.md map(diagnostics, fn(r) => {line: r.line, message: r.message}) --json
$ xmd query errors.x.md map(diagnostics, fn(r) => {line: r.line, message: r.message}) --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  {
    "line": 0,
    "message": "forecast_range end date must be on or after the start date"
  },
  {
    "line": 1,
    "message": "List exceeds 4096 items"
  },
  {
    "line": 2,
    "message": "Unknown temperature unit 'K'; use F or C"
  },
  {
    "line": 3,
    "message": "forecast_range expects 3 to 4 arguments, got 2"
  },
  {
    "line": 4,
    "message": "Expected a date or appointment time"
  }
]

