### 4 cli render weather.x.md --format text
$ xmd render weather.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
--- stdout
week := forecast_range("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, 2026-11-22, F) = <collection>
Highs: [sparkline(week.high)] ▁█▅
Rain: [sparkline(week.rain, 0%, 100%)] ▁▅█
Celsius: [debug(forecast_range("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, 2026-11-22).high)] [20,30,25]
One day: [sparkline(forecast_range("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, 2026-11-20).high)] ▅
Inline only: [sparkline(forecast_range("Oaxaca", 2026-11-24, 2026-11-25).high)] ▅▅

